## `ask-me` and `asking` Skills

Adapted from:

- `grill-me`: https://github.com/mattpocock/skills/tree/main/skills/productivity/grill-me
- `grilling`: https://github.com/mattpocock/skills/tree/main/skills/productivity/grilling
- Source commit: `3cca18b368ae95cdbdebbff572ccafa662551015`

Business OS modifications rename `grill-me` to `ask-me` and `grilling` to `asking`, and replace
the wrapper's runtime-specific Skill tool call with a read of `skills/asking/SKILL.md`. The canonical
`skills/asking/SKILL.md` engine body is otherwise unchanged from this source commit. The explicit-only
wrapper and automatic engine distinction are preserved. Grok Bot installs these same files
as skills, unchanged apart from a short header naming the Business OS folder.
Upstream source is pinned by the commit above.

